{"sourceSha256": "f3c70eff65d39813fc33f8b81b896b8d4f3c8c5ae20738a3578a61995018034d", "text": "Nurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurses:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nhours.\n\nAlright. And whenever you had the urge that you need to empty the\nbladder, were you able to postpone it comfortably?\n\nOh no, I get a desperate urge...\n\nOh no! That must be quite hard for you!\n\nYes, | feel like a failure...\n\nI am sorry to hear that!\n\nHmm\n\nSo, coming back to the urgency, how often do you get a sudden urge\nto urinate that makes you want to rush to the bathroom?\n\nAh well, since last few weeks...about 2-3 times a day!\n\nOK. | am afraid | need to ask you a personal question. Whenever you\nget a strong urge to empty the bladder, has there ever been a time\nwhen you could not get to the bathroom fast enough?\n\n(seemingly embarrassed) Ah... | try... | usually rush as soon as I can...\nburt...\n\nGo on...\n\nOn bad days, it leaks...\n\nOh, that must be difficult!\n\nYes. It's frustrating.\n\nI understand that it must have been distressing for you. Coming back\nto this, Did you seck any treatment for these?\n\nNo, | just thought it's due to getting older...and; it’s so embarrassing\nto talk about it.\n\nI can appreciate how difficult it is for you to talk about this, So, what\nkind of impact has it had on your lifestyle?\n\nAh, well, it’s turned my life around completely, | am constantly going\nto the bathroom. So I cannot go out or attend social events or travel to\nany place... | even stopped exercising for fear of leakage.\n\nThank you for telling me how you have been feeling. It helps me to\nunderstand the situation much better, Is there anything else that you\nwould like to add?", "pages": [{"number": 1, "text": "Nurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurses:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nhours.\n\nAlright. And whenever you had the urge that you need to empty the\nbladder, were you able to postpone it comfortably?\n\nOh no, I get a desperate urge...\n\nOh no! That must be quite hard for you!\n\nYes, | feel like a failure...\n\nI am sorry to hear that!\n\nHmm\n\nSo, coming back to the urgency, how often do you get a sudden urge\nto urinate that makes you want to rush to the bathroom?\n\nAh well, since last few weeks...about 2-3 times a day!\n\nOK. | am afraid | need to ask you a personal question. Whenever you\nget a strong urge to empty the bladder, has there ever been a time\nwhen you could not get to the bathroom fast enough?\n\n(seemingly embarrassed) Ah... | try... | usually rush as soon as I can...\nburt...\n\nGo on...\n\nOn bad days, it leaks...\n\nOh, that must be difficult!\n\nYes. It's frustrating.\n\nI understand that it must have been distressing for you. Coming back\nto this, Did you seck any treatment for these?\n\nNo, | just thought it's due to getting older...and; it’s so embarrassing\nto talk about it.\n\nI can appreciate how difficult it is for you to talk about this, So, what\nkind of impact has it had on your lifestyle?\n\nAh, well, it’s turned my life around completely, | am constantly going\nto the bathroom. So I cannot go out or attend social events or travel to\nany place... | even stopped exercising for fear of leakage.\n\nThank you for telling me how you have been feeling. It helps me to\nunderstand the situation much better, Is there anything else that you\nwould like to add?", "extraction": "ocr", "layout": {"version": 1, "width": 2285.0, "height": 2800.0, "blocks": [{"text": "Nurse:", "lines": [{"text": "Nurse:", "x": 0.13611, "y": 0.13393, "width": 0.06083, "height": 0.01357, "confidence": 0.966, "words": [{"text": "Nurse:", "x": 0.13611, "width": 0.06083, "confidence": 0.966}], "uncertainWords": []}]}, {"text": "Patient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:", "